ust-region Newton needs a small net (P≈115 worked, P=290 did not converge) and low-index starts.\n- Weibull extrapolations of heavily censored runs reach 1e9: hold such medians at the observed bound and flag them.\n- `| grep` on a killed foreground job loses the output: log to a file.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false,"memdirStamped":true},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01RmEmXRs1TVoLtmaNxv3e29","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
